stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks OnlyCurrentReadsSend or RecipientTimersAreIndependent
    lg1: Path to the OnlyCurrentReadsSend or RecipientTimersAreIndependent bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Recipients have opened the link
  s1: Reading the first piece
  s2: Waiting to send the next piece
  s3: The first read is still pending after restart
  s4: An old download sends a piece
  s5: One download loses its next piece
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a recipient starts downloading
  s1 --> s2: the piece arrives
  s1 --> s3: the recipient restarts
  s2 --> s5: a second recipient starts downloading
  s3 --> s4: the piece arrives
